@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}

<div class="container legal-page">
    <h1>About Us</h1>
    <div class="legal-content">
        <h3>The Essence of Premium Comfort</h3>
        <p>At Valous World, we believe a T-shirt is more than fabric — it’s a feeling. A reflection of who you are, what you stand for, and how you choose to show up every day.</p>
        
        <p>Our mission is simple — to create premium T-shirts that blend luxury, comfort, and timeless style for those who demand more from the basics.</p>

        <p>Every Valous piece is crafted with precision, using high-grade fabrics, refined tailoring, and minimal design that speaks volumes without saying a word. From the softness of the cotton to the strength of each stitch, every detail is made to deliver a lasting impression.</p>

        <p>We don’t chase trends — we define essentials. Our T-shirts are designed for the modern individual — bold, effortless, and authentic. Whether you’re on the move, at work, or out to make a statement, Valous brings you luxury that feels natural and looks unstoppable.</p>

        <p><strong>Welcome to Valous World — where comfort meets class, and style meets substance. Because premium isn’t a price — it’s a mindset.</strong></p>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .legal-page { padding: 50px 20px 80px; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .legal-page h1 { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 24px; text-transform: uppercase; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--black); padding-bottom: 16px; }
    .legal-content { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--gray-800); }
    .legal-content h3 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 24px 0 16px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .legal-content p { margin-bottom: 18px; }
    @@media (max-width: 600px) {
        .legal-page { padding: 30px 16px 60px; }
        .legal-page h1 { font-size: 22px; }
        .legal-content h3 { font-size: 16px; }
        .legal-content { font-size: 14px; }
    }
</style>